            {
              "id": "2a00013",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>Shaman Abhay Oyun is a shamanic elder of an ancient tradition of Siberian Shamanism. Throughout his life, he has traveled across 40 countries in search of ever new knowledge and spiritual insight, offering spiritual wisdom, humanitarian support, protective rituals, and direct energetic healing to those in need. </p><p>At the end of his long journey and teachings, his spiritual protectors sent him to North America with an important mission, one that is meant to raise the life of all humanity to a new stage of evolution: the awakening of the Sixth Race.</p>",
                "text_color": "#555c66",
                "typography_typography": "custom"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "2a00014",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border-top:1px solid rgba(212,168,83,0.25);margin-top:32px;padding-top:32px;\">\n    <div style=\"padding-right:24px;border-right:1px solid rgba(212,168,83,0.18);\">\n      <div style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:3rem;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d4a853,#9e7529);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;\">35+</div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(13,17,23,0.4);margin-top:8px;\">Years</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"padding:0 24px;border-right:1px solid rgba(212,168,83,0.18);\">\n      <div style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:3rem;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d4a853,#9e7529);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;\">40</div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(13,17,23,0.4);margin-top:8px;\">Countries</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"padding-left:24px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:3rem;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d4a853,#9e7529);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;\">10K+</div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(13,17,23,0.4);margin-top:8px;\">Healed</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
